---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="page prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Hello, I'm {SITE.author}.</p>
    <p>
      This is where I write about ideas worth returning to: how technology
      solves real problems, how reliable ways of working take shape, and the
      occasional moment of clarity in everyday life.
    </p>
    <p>
      I want these notes to remain useful after the moment has passed. The
      writing is unfinished by design: each post is a place to think in public,
      revise, and keep learning.
    </p>
    <p>You can find my projects on <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
